  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 1.0,
    "cls_id": "CH06149",
    "sub_id": "67806",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>評分規則說明</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>課程包括三次平時考試或是申論題問答筆試，<strong>至少須有兩次參與紀錄才可繳交期中報告</strong>。</div>\n\n<div>期中報告相關要求將於課程中公告。</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>課程部分規劃為小組討論，與課學生需積極參與課題討論。此位，課程內包含小組口頭報告呈現，需以團隊工作的模式擬定主題並發表口頭報告。兩部分表現皆列平時成績評量。</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>Grading Policy Explanation</div>\n\n<div>The course includes three regular quizzes or written exams with short-answer/essay questions. Students must have records of participation in <strong>at least two of these in order to be eligible to submit&nbsp;the individual midterm report</strong>.<br />\nRequirements related to the midterm report will be announced during the course.<br />\nPart of the course is organized around group discussions, and enrolled students are expected to actively participate in topic discussions. In addition, the course includes group oral presentations, which require students to work in teams&nbsp;and deliver oral presentations. Performance in both parts will be included in the assessment of regular coursework grades.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "課程講授與討論並重，每週會固定安排部分時間個別問答或是分組討論，需要同學保持彈性，積極極參。\n課程包括三次平時考試或是申論題問答筆試，至少須有兩次參與紀錄才可繳交或是參與個人期中報告。\n平時考試或是申論題問答期間禁止使用任何電子設備。\n未經許可、課程請勿錄音拍照或攝影。請同學以電子或是書面筆記紀錄講課內容。\n彈性授課內容包含實體授課或線上自主學習，於期末考試與口頭報告結束之後實施。\n所有課程規則將於課堂內公告與口頭說明。\n除特殊情況，若對於課堂內已公告或是討論的內容，有相關疑問，請同學親至課堂內提出問題，否則不另外通知或回覆線上傳送的訊息。\n＊本課程將視課程進行情況調整授課進度＊",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div><strong>綜合說明：</strong></div>\n\n<div>課程包括平時考試或是申論題問答筆試，至少須有兩次參與紀錄才可繳交或是參與個人期中報告與期末口頭報告。</div>\n\n<div>課程包括每週的小組討論時段，小組討論的參與情況列入成績評量。</div>\n\n<div>平時考試或是申論題問答期間禁止使用任何電子設備。</div>\n\n<div>勿翻攝上課簡報內容。</div>\n\n<div><strong>General Information:</strong><br />\nThe course includes regular quizzes or written exams with short-answer/essay questions. Students must have records of participation in at least two such assessments in order to be eligible to submit or participate in the individual midterm report and the final oral presentation.<br />\nThe course also includes weekly group discussion sessions, and participation in these discussions is included in the course assessment.<br />\nThe use of any electronic devices is prohibited during quizzes or written exams.<br />\nDo not photograph or record the lecture slides.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
